# Local request example. Supply variables from a PRIVATE client environment.
# Never paste a real password/token into this tracked file.
# Required variables: baseUrl, username, password, authToken.

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Owner dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
